{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾在先進制程代工業務上終於取得了一項重要突破。當地時間11月18日，英特爾行政總裁陳立武（Lip-Bu Tan）在美國德克薩斯州奧斯汀舉行的TomorrowX峯會上宣佈，公司已經籤署首份採用18A先進制程的外部客户合同。這意味着英特爾的先進制造技術首次獲得外部客户的正式訂單，為其挑戰台積電的晶圓代工業務提供了新的進展。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587070.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:24:04.098144+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:16:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:14.627081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:14.627081+00:00","content_hash":"b3fc92fd29830fbb95c22f3279ff3d938248fa50b9502ae06a91fe702d8d31c4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}